        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: Choose T=0T = 0T=0 to get (20⋅3) mod 7=3(2^0 \\cdot 3) \\bmod 7 = 3(20⋅3)mod7=3, which is the minimum possible value.\nTest case 222: Choose T=1T = 1T=1 to get (101⋅8) mod 11=80 mod 11=3(10^1 \\cdot 8)\\bmod 11 = 80 \\bmod 11 = 3(101⋅8)mod11=80mod11=3, which is the minimum possible value."
      }
